PII recognizer patterns and validation approach adapted from Presidio.
Source: https://github.com/microsoft/presidio/tree/fbe0ef4f29124bc3a3ab8a6562276dd9cfb269fd
Spain DNI/NIE use the es_nif_recognizer.py and es_nie_recognizer.py
mod-23 approach, with stricter eight-digit DNI and XYZ-prefix NIE shapes.
Checksum algorithms are public standards. This implementation does not bundle
Presidio's NLP runtime or claim its recognizer coverage.

